NativeScript Canvas 2.1.18 iOS ARM64 device framework
Upstream: https://github.com/NativeScript/canvas
Revision: 1fd6ef470dfdfd43b3385fa7ef43feddd1debd06
License: Apache-2.0 (LICENSE alongside this file).

Contains Haiyue's context readback texture, shader module and command encoder
lifetime fixes, plus weak notification and touch-handler references in the Apple
wrapper. See ../../patches/canvas-2.1.18-resource-lifetime.patch,
../../patches/canvas-2.1.18-apple-lifetime.patch and ../../patches/README.md.
The upstream Xcode prebuild hook is temporarily bypassed after the locked Rust
library is built. Objective-C sources and C headers are unchanged.

Only the ios-arm64 device slice is replaced. No simulator/visionOS acceptance
is implied. Build provenance and per-file checksums are in identity.json.
